[en.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_1]
Liberation Front

[en.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_1_desc]
Whether called the Liberation Front or the Resistance, this organization established when Starlight Glimmer arrived at Our Town, has an ultimate goal of overthrowing the illegal empire of Cozy Glow, reclaiming all of Equestria, bringing down the “Big Three”, and restoring friendship and harmony to all ponies.
The Front has since fallen apart. Ponies have abandoned their ideals, fighting for the present and even against each other. Starlight Glimmer stands in the streets, looking sadly at the desolate land before her, as the Windigos begin to descend, covering the land in snow and ice, hiding the remaining strife and apathy.

§RMay Celestia Be With Us§!

[zh.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_1]
解放阵线

[zh.IDEA_C08_LIBERATION_FRONT_1_desc]
无论叫做解放阵线抑或是抵抗军，这一星光熠熠流亡平等镇后建立的组织，其最终目的是推翻和煦光流的伪帝国，讨伐“三巨头”，收复全小马利亚，将友谊与谐律重新带给所有小马。
阵线目前分崩离析。小马们已经背弃了理想，拼命争夺着眼下的利益，甚至为此兵戈相向。星光熠熠站在街道上，痛心地望着眼前的一片萧条零落，天上的风之魔已经开始降下冰雪，掩盖这片土地剩余的纷争与冷漠。

§R塞拉斯蒂娅在上，愿我们能渡过难关。§!
